/**
 * @file[zh-cn] Scene 场景管理父包声明
 * @brief[zh-cn] 本文件仅用于声明 three.scene 包，便于 cjpm 识别 scenegraph/entity/ecs/objects/interfaces 子包
 * @explain[zh-cn] three.scene 提供完整的场景管理模块，对应 Three.js 的 scene 模块，涵盖场景图（scenegraph）、可渲染实体（entity）、ECS 框架（ecs）、3D 对象基类与射线投射（objects）以及跨包解耦接口（interfaces）。
 *
 * @file[en] Scene  Declaration of the scene module parent package
 * @brief[en] This file only declares the three.scene package so cjpm can recognize the scenegraph/entity/ecs/objects/interfaces subpackages
 * @explain[en] three.scene provides a complete scene management module mirroring the Three.js scene module, covering scene graph (scenegraph), renderable entities (entity), ECS framework (ecs), 3D object base classes and raycasting (objects), and cross-package decoupling interfaces (interfaces).
 */
package three.scene
